      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. could you get a bit more specific on how the \"demographic volatility\" part would actually work in the model? like, if we see a sudden influx of certain immigrant populations or a shift in the ethnic makeup of a neighborhood, how should the algorithm weigh that against the crime stats to predict unrest? i want to make sure the model is accurately capturing the tension that usually comes with those kinds of demographic shifts.",
